{"info": {"address1": "Trent House, G-Block", "address2": "Plot No. C-60 Beside Citibank Bandra Kurla Complex Bandra (East)", "city": "Mumbai", "zip": "400051", "country": "India", "phone": "91 22 6700 9000", "fax": "91 22 6700 8100", "website": "https://trentlimited.com", "industry": "Apparel Retail", "industryKey": "apparel-retail", "industryDisp": "Apparel Retail", "sector": "Consumer Cyclical", "sectorKey": "consumer-cyclical", "sectorDisp": "Consumer Cyclical", "longBusinessSummary": "Trent Limited engages in the retailing and trading of apparels, footwear, accessories, food, grocery, and non-food products in India. The company provides apparel, footwear, and accessories for men, women, and children, as well as furnishings, decor, and a range of home accessories under the Westside brand; apparels and footwear for men, women, and children under the Zudio brand; ethnic apparels, beauty products, and accessories under the Utsa brand; and luxurious occasion and ethnic wear for men and women under the Samoh brand. Additionally, it operates a youth-focused fashion brand, called, Burnt Toast. It also operates Star Hypermarket, a convenience store chain that offers a range of products, including staple foods, beverages, health and beauty products, apparel, home furnishings, vegetables, fruits, dairy, and non-vegetarian products; and Booker Wholesale, a cash and carry chain of stores, which provides various products, such as staple foods, beverages, health and beauty products, dairy, non-vegetarian products, and non-food products to caterers, retailers, and other businesses. In addition, the company engages in the operation of StarQuik for online grocery retailing; provision of business support and outsourcing services relating to accounting, merchandising, human resources, payroll, sourcing, warehousing, distribution, etc.; and franchisee business, as well as designing, development, and manufacture of apparel and apparel related products. Further, it sells its products online through Westside.com, Tata CliQ, and Tata Neu, as well as My Star App. Trent Limited was incorporated in 1952 and is based in Mumbai, India.", "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Venkatesalu  Palaniswamy", "age": 48, "title": "MD & Executive Director", "yearBorn": 1977, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 134500000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Neeraj  Basur ACA, ACS, M.Com", "age": 56, "title": "Chief Financial Officer", "yearBorn": 1969, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. P. K. Anand", "age": 71, "title": "Senior Vice-President of Operations", "yearBorn": 1954, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. S. W. Kamat", "age": 71, "title": "General Manager of Finance & Accounts", "yearBorn": 1954, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Krupa Ketan Anandpara", "title": "Company Secretary & Compliance Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Manish  Kumar B.Sc., M.S.J.R., M.Sc., P.G.D.P.", "age": 57, "title": "Head of Human Recourse", "yearBorn": 1968, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Sanjay  Rastogi", "age": 58, "title": "Head - New Business, Strategy, CSR & ESG", "yearBorn": 1967, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Shailesh  Solkar", "title": "Head of Merchandising & Supply Chain", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Damani  Madhulika", "title": "Head of Indian Wear", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Ratul  Neogi", "title": "Head of Internal Audit & BR", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}], "auditRisk": 5, "boardRisk": 6, "compensationRisk": 2